@startuml
title Wearable HAR MLOps — runtime and review (research prototype)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
actor "Research operator" as Operator
rectangle "Offline-first runtime" {
  [Sensor ingestion] as Ingest
  [Validation] as Validate
  [Transformation\n50 Hz; 200×6; stride 100] as Transform
  [Model D1 inference\n1D-CNN + BiLSTM] as Infer
  [Evaluation] as Evaluate
  [3-layer monitoring] as Monitor
  [Trigger evaluation] as Trigger
}
database "Garmin train scaler\nModel D1 baseline" as Artifacts
rectangle "Conditional / governed" {
  [Review and label QA] as QA
  [Candidate retraining] as Retrain
  [Model registration] as Register
  [Baseline update] as Baseline
}
Operator --> Ingest : new sensor session
Ingest --> Validate
Validate --> Transform
Artifacts --> Transform : frozen scaler
Transform --> Infer
Artifacts --> Infer : frozen weights
Infer --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> Monitor
Monitor --> Trigger
Trigger --> QA : review signal
QA ..> Retrain : only with approval
Retrain --> Register : candidate accepted
Register --> Baseline : controlled update
note bottom of Trigger
No unattended model promotion.
Research system; not medical diagnosis.
end note
@enduml
